Build the executables

Open a terminal in that folder and run:

make


This will compile and produce:

./CacheController
./TraceGenerator


If make fails, run manually:

g++ -std=c++17 -O2 CacheController.cpp -o CacheController
g++ -std=c++17 -O2 TraceGenerator.cpp -o TraceGenerator

Generate a trace (matrix-multiplication–style)

Example:

./TraceGenerator 64 64 1 4 example_trace.txt

Run the cache simulator

Use:

./CacheController config.cfg example_trace.txt